--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c0dc09dbaa30e694681d8e3582c8800f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dia_Doctor_PeasantCoughing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Peasant coughing
  speakingCharacters:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1ac0a97e9935a5844bca54735b28090f, type: 2}
    dialogueLines:
    - line: 'Despite my busy schedule, I followed your advice and checked on the
        sickness that is spreading between the peasants. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Thank you. And? '
        responseToChoice: So far, the symptoms include some heavy coughing and mild-to-high
          fevers.
        consequences: []
        dailyChanges: []
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 0}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
    - line: 'If you really think it is necessary to intervene, then I would distribute
        some general medicine to them - but the amount of sick people makes this
        costly. Of course, we could also just quarantine the people and wait for
        it to pass. '
      choices:
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Distribute the medicine - we need our people healthy. '
        responseToChoice: 'Yes, of course. '
        consequences:
        - type: 0
          amount: -100
        - type: 6
          amount: 15
        - type: 5
          amount: 10
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 3
          amount: -1
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d28288e950672f4791894eb4434838c, type: 2}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: 'Ignore it - we don''t have the resource the spend on coughing
          and fevers. '
        responseToChoice: 'I understand, I am sure they will overcome this themselves. '
        consequences:
        - type: 5
          amount: -25
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 3
          amount: -2
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d28288e950672f4791894eb4434838c, type: 2}
      - conditionToShow: {fileID: 0}
        conditionToHide: {fileID: 0}
        choiceText: Quarantine them - we don't want to risk a mass infection or worse.
        responseToChoice: 'You are right about that. I will organize it. '
        consequences:
        - type: 5
          amount: -15
        - type: 6
          amount: -10
        dailyChanges:
        - type: 1
          amount: -1
        receivingVaribale: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c02c0788318b4334ab9bd8679991984b, type: 2}
      isFinalLine: 0
      nextSpeakerID: 0
